<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="62" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">Institutional Group I-1 occupancy shall include buildings, structures or portions thereof for more than 16 persons, excluding staff, who reside on a 24-hour basis in a supervised environment and receive custodial care.</source>
<target xml:space="preserve"></target>
