<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="62" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">Buildings of Group I-1 shall be classified as one of the occupancy conditions specified in Section 308.2.1 or 308.2.2 and shall comply with Section 420.</source>
