<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="64" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">This occupancy condition shall include buildings in which all persons receiving custodial care who, without any assistance, are capable of responding to an emergency situation to complete building evacuation.</source>
<target xml:space="preserve"></target>
