<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="78" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">Buildings of Group I-2 shall be classified as one of the occupancy conditions specified in Section 308.3.1.1 or 308.3.1.2 and shall comply with Section 407.</source>
