<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="79" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">This occupancy condition shall include facilities that provide nursing and medical care but do not provide emergency care, surgery, obstetrics or in-patient stabilization units for psychiatric or detoxification, including but not limited to nursing homes and foster care facilities.</source>
<target xml:space="preserve"></target>
