<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="92" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">This occupancy condition shall include buildings in which free movement is allowed from sleeping areas, and other spaces where access or occupancy is permitted, to the exterior via means of egress without restraint.</source>
<target xml:space="preserve"></target>
