<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="94" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">This occupancy condition shall include buildings in which free movement is allowed within individual smoke compartments, such as within a residential unit composed of individual sleeping units and group activity spaces, where egress is impeded by remote-controlled release of means of egress from such a smoke compartment to another smoke compartment.</source>
<target xml:space="preserve"></target>
