<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="112" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject"><bpt id="1" ctype="bold">{}</bpt><bpt id="2" rid="1">&lt;rpr id=&quot;26&quot;&gt;</bpt>602.4 Type IV. <ept id="1">{}</ept><ept id="3" rid="1">&lt;/rpr id=&quot;26&quot; transform=&quot;close&quot;&gt;</ept><ph id="4">&lt;rpr id=&quot;14&quot;&gt;</ph>Type IV construction is that type of construction in which the building elements are mass timber or noncombustible materials and have fire-resistance ratings in accordance with Table 601.</source>
<target xml:space="preserve"></target>
<context-group>
