<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="112" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">Mass timber elements of Types IV-A, IV-B and IV-C construction shall be protected with noncombustible protection applied directly to the mass timber in accordance with Sections 602.4.1 through 602.4.3.</source>
<target xml:space="preserve"></target>
<context-group>
