<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="112" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">The time assigned to the noncombustible protection shall be determined in accordance with Section 703.6 and comply with Section 722.7.<ph id="1">&lt;/rpr id=&quot;14&quot; transform=&quot;close&quot;&gt;</ph></source>
