<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="124" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">Interior faces of all mass timber elements, including the inside faces of exterior mass timber walls and mass timber roofs, shall be protected with materials complying with Section 703.3.</source>
<target xml:space="preserve"></target>
