<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="137" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">The ASTM E1354 test shall be conducted on specimens at the thickness intended for use, in the horizontal orientation and at an incident radiant heat flux of 50 kW/m2.<ph id="1">&lt;/rpr id=&quot;14&quot; transform=&quot;close&quot;&gt;</ph></source>
