<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="146" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">Unprotected portions of mass timber ceilings, including attached beams, shall be permitted and shall be limited to an area equal to 20 percent of the floor area in any dwelling unit or fire area.</source>
