<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="147" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">Unprotected portions of mass timber walls, including attached columns, shall be permitted and shall be limited to an area equal to 40 percent of the floor area in any dwelling unit or fire area.</source>
