<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="148" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">Unprotected portions of both walls and ceilings of mass timber, including attached columns and beams, in any dwelling unit or fire area shall be permitted in accordance with Section 602.4.2.2.3.</source>
