<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="149" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">Mass timber columns and beams that are not an integral portion of walls or ceilings, respectively, shall be permitted to be unprotected without restriction of either aggregate area or separation from one another.</source>
