<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="160" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">In each dwelling unit or fire area, unprotected portions of mass timber walls and ceilings shall be not less than 15 feet (4572 mm) from unprotected portions of other walls and ceilings, measured horizontally along the ceiling and from other unprotected portions of walls measured horizontally along the floor.</source>
