<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="164" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">The interior surfaces of roof assemblies shall be protected in accordance with Section 602.4.2.2 except, in non occupiable spaces, they shall be treated as a concealed space with no portion left unprotected.</source>
