<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="166" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">Concealed spaces shall not contain combustibles other than electrical, mechanical, fire protection, or plumbing materials and equipment permitted in plenums in accordance with Section 602 of the International Mechanical Code, and shall comply with all applicable provisions of Section 718.</source>
