<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="186" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">Fire-retardant-treated wood framing and sheathing complying with Section 2303.2 shall be permitted within exterior wall assemblies with a 2-hour rating or less.</source>
