<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="188" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">Cross-laminated timber (CLT) not less than 4 inches (102 mm) in thickness complying with Section 2303.1.4 shall be permitted within exterior wall assemblies with a 2-hour rating or less.</source>
