<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="188" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">Heavy timber structural members appurtenant to the CLT exterior wall shall meet the requirements of Table 2304.11 and be fire-resistance rated as required for the exterior wall.</source>
