<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="205" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">Party walls and fire walls are not required on lot lines dividing a building for ownership purposes where the aggregate height and area of the portions of the building located on both sides of the lot line do not exceed the maximum height and area requirements of this code.</source>
