<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="238" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">Exposed portions of building elements complying with the requirements for buildings of heavy timber construction in Section 602.4 or Section 2304.11 shall not be subject to interior finish requirements except in interior exit stairways, interior exit ramps, and exit passageways.</source>
