<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="263" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">The laminated product shall meet the criteria of Section 803.1.1.1 when tested in accordance with NFPA 286 using the product-mounting system, including adhesive, as described in Section 5.8 of NFPA 286.</source>
<target xml:space="preserve"></target>
<context-group>
