<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="272" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">Interior finish materials regulated by this Chapter shall be applied or otherwise fastened in such a manner that such materials will not readily become detached where subjected to room temperatures of 200°F (93°C) for not less than 30 minutes.</source>
<target xml:space="preserve"></target>
<context-group>
