<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="274" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">Where interior finish materials are applied on walls, ceilings or structural elements required to have a fire-resistance rating or to be of noncombustible construction, these finish materials shall comply with the provisions of this section.</source>
<target xml:space="preserve"></target>
<context-group>
