<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="276" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">Where walls, ceilings or structural elements are required by any provision in this code to be of fire-resistance-rated or noncombustible construction, the interior finish material shall be applied directly against such construction or to furring strips not exceeding 13/4 inches (44 mm), applied directly against such surfaces.</source>
