<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="287" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">Where interior finish materials are attached to noncombustible backing or furring strips installed as specified in Section 803.15.1.1.</source>
<target xml:space="preserve"></target>
