<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="290" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">The hangers and assembly members of such dropped ceilings that are below the horizontal fire-resistance-rated floor or roof assemblies shall be of noncombustible materials.</source>
