<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="290" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">The construction of each set-out wall and horizontal fire-resistance-rated floor or roof assembly shall be of fire-resistance-rated construction as required elsewhere in this code.</source>
