<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="295" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">An interior wall or ceiling finish material that is not more than 1/4 inch (6.4 mm) thick shall be applied directly onto the wall, ceiling or structural element without the use of furring strips and shall not be suspended away from the building element to which that finish material it is applied.</source>
<target xml:space="preserve"></target>
