<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="298" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">Materials that meet the requirements of Class A materials in accordance with Section 803.1.1 or 803.1.2 where the qualifying tests were made with the material suspended away from the noncombustible backing shall be permitted to be used suspended away from the building element.</source>
