<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="301" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">Throughout a story in a Group I-2 occupancy, any change in elevation in portions of the means of egress that serve non-ambulatory persons shall be by means of a ramp or sloped walkway.</source>
