<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="340" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">Buildings classified as Group R-2 equipped throughout with an automatic sprinkler system in accordance with <bpt id="1" rid="1">&lt;hlnk id=&quot;rId21&quot; history=&quot;1&quot; fileName=&quot;document.xml&quot; href=&quot;@efce19cc-9616-41c1-894f-dbe268168e5c&quot;&gt;</bpt>Section 903.3.1.1<ept id="2" rid="1">&lt;/hlnk&gt;</ept> or <bpt id="3" rid="2">&lt;hlnk id=&quot;rId22&quot; history=&quot;1&quot; fileName=&quot;document.xml&quot; href=&quot;@bf9dd5b1-9522-45ae-84b2-69d1bb80b984&quot;&gt;</bpt>903.3.1.2<ept id="4" rid="2">&lt;/hlnk&gt;</ept> and provided with emergency escape and rescue openings in accordance with <bpt id="5" rid="3">&lt;hlnk id=&quot;rId23&quot; history=&quot;1&quot; fileName=&quot;document.xml&quot; href=&quot;@74e859c7-7466-4a75-bcdb-8fa663faf12c&quot;&gt;</bpt>Section 1031<ept id="6" rid="3">&lt;/hlnk&gt;</ept>.</source>
