<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="344" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">3.<ph id="1">&lt;mq:ch val=&quot;	&quot; /&gt;</ph>In Group R-3 occupancies; within dwelling units in Group R-2 occupancies; and in Group U occupancies that are accessory to a Group R-3 occupancy or accessory to individual dwelling units in Group R-2 occupancies; the maximum riser height shall be 73/4 inches (197 mm); the minimum tread depth shall be 10 inches (254 mm); the minimum winder tread depth at the walkline shall be 10 inches (254 mm); and the minimum winder tread depth shall be 6 inches (152 mm).</source>
