<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="344" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">A nosing projection not less than 3/4 inch (19.1 mm) but not more than 11/4 inches (32 mm) shall be provided on stairways with solid risers where the tread depth is less than 11 inches (279 mm).</source>
