<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="355" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">2.<ph id="1">&lt;mq:ch val=&quot;	&quot; /&gt;</ph>In Group F, H and S occupancies, other than areas of parking structures accessible to the public, openings in treads and landings shall not be prohibited provided that a sphere with a diameter of 11/8 inches (29 mm) cannot pass through the opening.</source>
<target xml:space="preserve"></target>
