<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="357" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">Outdoor stairways and outdoor approaches to stairways shall be designed so that water will not accumulate on walking surfaces.</source>
<target xml:space="preserve"></target>
