<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="362" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">The radius restriction shall not apply to curved stairways in Group R-3 and within individual dwelling units in Group R-2.</source>
<target xml:space="preserve"></target>
