<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="369" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">2.Decks, patios and walkways that have a single change in elevation where the landing depth on each side of the change of elevation is greater than what is required for a landing do not require handrails.</source>
