<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="386" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">Electrically powered, self-luminous and photoluminescent exit signs shall be listed and labeled in accordance with UL 924 and shall be installed in accordance with the manufacturer's instructions and Chapter 27.</source>
<target xml:space="preserve"></target>
