<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="391" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">If a chevron directional indicator is provided as part of the exit sign, the construction shall be such that the direction of the chevron directional indicator cannot be readily changed.</source>
<target xml:space="preserve"></target>
