<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="393" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">The face of an exit sign illuminated from an external source shall have an intensity of not less than 5 footcandles (54 lux).</source>
<target xml:space="preserve"></target>
