<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="396" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">Approved exit sign illumination types that provide continuous illumination independent of external power sources for a duration of not less than 90 minutes, in case of primary power loss, are not required to be connected to an emergency electrical system.</source>
