<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="413" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">Along alternating tread devices and ships ladders, guards where the top rail serves as a handrail shall have height not less than 30 inches (762 mm) and not more than 34 inches (864 mm), measured vertically from the leading edge of the device tread nosing.</source>
<target xml:space="preserve"></target>
