<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="415" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject"><ph id="1">&lt;mq:nt id=&quot;2544&quot; text=&quot;4. &quot; type=&quot;hidden&quot; /&gt;</ph><bpt id="2" rid="1">&lt;rpr id=&quot;14&quot;&gt;</bpt>In areas that are not open to the public within occupancies in Group I-3, F, H or S, and for alternating tread devices and ships ladders, guards shall not have openings that allow passage of a sphere 21 inches (533 mm) in diameter.<ept id="3" rid="1">&lt;/rpr id=&quot;14&quot; transform=&quot;close&quot;&gt;</ept></source>
