<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="416" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">In assembly seating areas, guards required at the end of aisles in accordance with Section 1030.17.4 shall not have openings that allow passage of a sphere 4 inches (102 mm) in diameter up to a height of 26 inches (660 mm).</source>
