<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="416" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">From a height of 26 inches (660 mm) to 42 inches (1067 mm) above the adjacent walking surfaces, guards shall not have openings that allow passage of a sphere 8 inches (203 mm) in diameter.</source>
