<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="421" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">Guards shall be provided where various components that require service are located within 10 feet (3048 mm) of a roof edge or open side of a walking surface and such edge or open side is located more than 30 inches (762 mm) above the floor, roof or grade below.</source>
