<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="450" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject"><ph id="1">&lt;mq:nt id=&quot;2456&quot; text=&quot;1&quot; type=&quot;hidden&quot; /&gt;</ph><bpt id="2" rid="1">&lt;rpr id=&quot;14&quot;&gt;</bpt>.<ph id="3">&lt;mq:ch val=&quot;	&quot; /&gt;</ph>Use of a corridor as a source of makeup air for exhaust systems in rooms that open directly onto such corridors, including toilet rooms, bathrooms, dressing rooms, smoking lounges and janitor closets, shall be permitted, provided that each such corridor is directly supplied with outdoor air at a rate greater than the rate of makeup air taken from the corridor.<ept id="4" rid="1">&lt;/rpr id=&quot;14&quot; transform=&quot;close&quot;&gt;</ept></source>
