<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="504" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">At least 5 percent, but not less than one, of the total number of aisle seats provided shall be designated aisle seats and shall be the aisle seats located closest to accessible routes.</source>
