<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="514" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">Where a building contains more than one room or space used for assembly purposes, the total number of required receivers shall be permitted to be calculated based on the total number of seats in the building, provided that all receivers are usable with all systems and if the rooms or spaces used for assembly purposes required to provide assistive listening are under one management.</source>
<target xml:space="preserve"></target>
<context-group>
<context context-type="x-mmq-structural-context">trans-units / trans-unit#5414 / struct-rpr#1</context>
