<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="549" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">An accessible route between accessible levels and stories above or below is not required where permitted by Section 1104.4, Exception 1.</source>
<target xml:space="preserve"></target>
<context-group>
<context context-type="x-mmq-structural-context">trans-units / trans-unit#5449 / struct-rpr#1</context>
