<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="554" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">Where dining surfaces for the consumption of food or drink are provided, at least 5 percent, but not less than one, of the dining surfaces for the seating and standing spaces shall be accessible and be distributed throughout the facility and located on a level accessed by an accessible route.</source>
