<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="618" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">Service sinks shall not be required to be located in individual tenant spaces in a covered mall provided that service sinks are located within a distance of travel of 300 feet (91 m) of the most remote location in the tenant space and not more than one story above or below the tenant space.</source>
