<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="621" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">The waste connector and sealing gasket joint shall comply with the joint tightness test of ASME A112.4.3 and shall be installed in accordance with the manufacturer’s instructions.</source>
