<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="624" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">Floor flanges of hard lead shall weigh not less than 1 pound, 9 ounces (0.7 kg) and shall be composed of lead alloy with not less than 7.75-percent antimony by weight.</source>
