<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="636" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">Where any fixture is provided with an overflow, the waste shall be designed and installed so that standing water in the fixture will not rise in the overflow when the stopper is closed, and water will not remain in the overflow when the fixture is empty.</source>
