<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="641" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">Fixtures with concealed slip-joint connections shall be provided with an access panel or utility space not less than 12 inches (305 mm) in its smallest dimension or other approved arrangement so as to provide access to the slip-joint connections for inspection and repair.</source>
