<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="647" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">The water supply to an automatic clothes washer shall be protected against backflow by an air gap that is integral with the machine or a backflow preventer shall be installed in accordance with Section 608.</source>
