<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="649" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">The fixture drain for the standpipe serving an automatic clothes washer shall connect to a 3-inch (76 mm) or larger diameter fixture branch or stack.</source>
