<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="707" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">Where two or more receptacle outlets are provided in a kitchen above a length of countertop that is uninterrupted by a sink or appliance, one receptacle outlet shall not be required to comply with this section.</source>
