<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="744" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">In new buildings and facilities, an accessible route with a clear width less than 60 inches (1525 mm) shall provide passing spaces at intervals of 200 feet (61 m) maximum.</source>
<target xml:space="preserve"></target>
<context-group>
