<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="750" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">Openings more than 24 inches (610 mm) in depth at doors and door- ways without doors shall provide a clear opening width of 36 inches (915 mm) minimum.</source>
