<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="769" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">Tempered glass doors without stiles and having a bottom rail or shoe with the top leading edge tapered at no less than 60 degrees from the horizontal shall not be required to comply with the 10-inch (255 mm) bottom rail height requirement.</source>
<target xml:space="preserve"></target>
<context-group>
