<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="773" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">doors, gates and sidelites adjacent to doors or gates containing one or more glazing panels that permit viewing through the panels shall have the bottom of at least one panel on either the door, gate or an adjacent sidelite 43 inches (1090 mm) maximum above the floor.</source>
