<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="776" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">Power-assist doors and gates and low-energy automatic doors and gates shall comply with ANSI/BHMA A156.19 listed in Section 106.2.6.</source>
<target xml:space="preserve"></target>
