<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="778" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">Where an automatic door or gate is required at a building or facility public entrance, it shall be a full powered automatic or a low-energy automatic door or gate.</source>
<target xml:space="preserve"></target>
