<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="846" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">Outside of the compartment, where the approach is to the latch side of the wheelchair accessible toilet compartment, door clearance between the door side of the compartment and any obstruction shall be 42 inches (1065 mm) minimum.</source>
