<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="848" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">In an alternate wheelchair accessible toilet compartment, the door shall be permitted to swing into  the stall where a clear floor space complying with Section 305.3 is provided within the stall beyond the arc of the door swing</source>
