<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="850" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">The front partition and at least one side partition of wheelchair accessible toilet compartments primarily for children’s use shall provide a toe clearance of 12 inches (305 mm) minimum above the floor and extending 8 inches (205 mm) beyond the wheelchair accessible toilet compartment side face of the partition, exclusive of partition support members.</source>
<target xml:space="preserve"></target>
<context-group>
<context context-type="x-mmq-structural-context">trans-units / trans-unit#7603 / struct-rpr#1</context>
