<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="851" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">Toe clearance at the front partition is not required in a wheelchair accessible toilet compartment greater than 67 inches (1700 mm) in depth.</source>
<target xml:space="preserve"></target>
